---
description: Rules for harness docs, adapter files, and repository-wide AI consistency.
globs:
  - "docs/**/*.md"
  - ".claude/**/*"
  - ".github/copilot-instructions.md"
  - "CLAUDE.md"
  - "agents.md"
---

When changing docs or adapter files:

- `docs/*` are the source of truth and adapter files are projections.
- Keep `CLAUDE.md`, `.github/copilot-instructions.md`, and `.cursor/rules/*` aligned with the same rules.
- Keep terminology consistent: Korean prose, English identifiers for scenario/type/version keys.
- Do not create prompt-only or workflow-only changes without matching scenario/eval updates.
